{"title": "根因：--with-openssl 是源码树语义", "lines": [{"t": "cmd", "s": "./configure --help | grep with-openssl"}, {"t": "out", "s": "--with-openssl=DIR  set path to OpenSSL library sources"}, {"t": "cmd", "s": "sed -n 1196,1200p objs/Makefile"}, {"t": "out", "s": "/usr/local/openssl/.openssl/include/openssl/ssl.h:"}, {"t": "out", "s": "\tcd /usr/local/openssl \\"}, {"t": "out", "s": "\t&& ./config --prefix=/usr/local/openssl/.openssl \\"}, {"t": "out", "s": "\t   no-shared no-threads && $(MAKE) && ..."}, {"t": "note", "s": "实测：nginx 1.19.9 —— 它要在该目录跑 config 构建源码"}]}